---
import SwissLayout from '../../layouts/SwissLayout.astro';
import { SELF_HOSTING_REPO_URL } from '../../lib/landing-data';

const linkClass = 'text-accent-text hover:text-text-primary underline';
---

<SwissLayout
  title="Terms of Service — GoPayLocal"
  description="GoPayLocal terms of service. Read our terms and conditions for using the service."
>
  <section class="py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[34rem] px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <p class="inline-block bg-accent-500 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
          Legal
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text-primary">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-muted">
          Last updated: November 21, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            By accessing or using GoPayLocal ("Service"), you agree to be bound
            by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these
            Terms, you may not use the Service.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
            2. Description of Service
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            GoPayLocal provides purchasing power parity (PPP) discount tools for
            digital products. The Service includes a JavaScript widget,
            dashboard, API, and related tools that enable you to offer
            location-based pricing to your customers.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            These Terms cover the Service we host at gopaylocal.com. The
            GoPayLocal software is open source. If you run your own copy of
            it, its open-source licenses apply (see section 6), not these
            Terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">3. Account Terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            You must be at least 18 years old to use the Service. You must
            provide accurate and complete registration information. You are
            responsible for maintaining the security of your account and API
            keys. You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your
            account.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
            4. Acceptable Use
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            You agree not to use the Service to violate any applicable laws or
            regulations; to get around the limits of your plan; to resell or
            sublicense access to the Service we host without our prior written
            consent; or to interfere with or disrupt the integrity or
            performance of the Service.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Nothing in this section limits what the open-source licenses let
            you do with the GoPayLocal source code, including running,
            changing and redistributing your own copy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
            5. Payment and Billing
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Free plans are provided at no cost. Paid plans are billed monthly or
            annually as selected. Paid plans come with a 30-day money-back
            guarantee: ask us within 30 days of your first payment for a plan
            and we refund that payment in full. Other fees are non-refundable.
            We may change our pricing with 30 days' notice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
            6. Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            The GoPayLocal software is open source. The applications (API,
            dashboard, admin, website and documentation) are licensed under the
            GNU Affero General Public License, version 3. The SDKs, the banner
            script and the shared packages are licensed under the MIT License.
            The license texts and the details are in
            <a href={`${SELF_HOSTING_REPO_URL}/blob/main/LICENSING.md`} class={linkClass}>LICENSING.md</a>
            in the source repository. Those licenses, not these Terms, govern
            your use of the source code.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            The GoPayLocal name and logo are ours, and the licenses above do
            not grant a right to use them. You retain all rights to your own
            content and data.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">7. Termination</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            We may terminate or suspend your account at any time for violations
            of these Terms. You may terminate your account at any time by
            contacting us. Upon termination, your right to use the Service will
            immediately cease.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
            8. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            To the maximum extent permitted by law, GoPayLocal shall not be
            liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or
            punitive damages, or any loss of profits or revenues, whether
            incurred directly or indirectly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">9. Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. We will
            provide notice of material changes via email or through the Service.
            Your continued use of the Service after changes constitutes
            acceptance of the new Terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary">10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at
            <a href="mailto:legal@gopaylocal.com" class={linkClass}>legal@gopaylocal.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SwissLayout>
